# kicad-mac-builder/bin holds tracked build scripts (apple.py, package.sh,
# fetch-edge-headless.sh, verify-edge-headless.sh, pin-edge-headless.py, ...). A global gitignore
# rule for any directory named "bin" would hide newly added files there, so
# re-include the directory explicitly (repository rules win over global ones).
!kicad-mac-builder/bin/